<title>BELGIUM: Belgian ASLK/CGER bank launches Internet site.</title>
<headline>Belgian ASLK/CGER bank launches Internet site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank  ASLK-CGER said it had launched an Internet site on Friday which gave information about CGER's banking and insurance divisions.</p>
<p>The site is accessible at http://www.cger.be and is accompanied by a &quot;Club 001&quot; section for young people, which can be found at http://www.cger.be/club 001.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
